{"lang":"tl","dir":"ltr","title":"Chateau Barber Shop | Walk-in na barbero sa downtown Napa, CA","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Lumaktaw sa nilalaman</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C</span><span>Chateau Barber Shop</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">Tungkol sa amin</a><a href=\"#services\">Serbisyo</a><a href=\"#team\">Mga barbero</a><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"#gallery\">Mga larawan</a><a href=\"#reviews\">Mga review</a><a href=\"#visit\">Oras at lokasyon</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"Wika\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\" selected>Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\">Tumawag</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Barbershop · Downtown Napa · Mula 2005</p>\n    <h1>Chateau Barber Shop</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Ang walk-in na barbershop ng downtown Napa. Precision cut, balbas at straight-razor, kung sino ang mauna ay siyang unang gugupitan.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.9 · 122 review sa Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Tawagan ang shop</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%2C%201521%203rd%20St%2C%20Napa%2C%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Direksyon</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>20 taon sa Third St</li><li>Walk-in lang, kung sino ang mauna</li><li>Cash lang</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4.9★ mula sa 122 review</a></li><li>Downtown Napa</li><li>Accessible sa wheelchair</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Ang aming kuwento</p><h2>Dalawampung taon ng gupit at samahan.</h2><p>Ang may-ari na si Santysouk &quot;San&quot; Yankee ay taga-Laos, kung saan siya natutong gumupit at mag-ayos ng buhok ng mga lalaki at nagpatakbo ng sarili niyang salon. Dumating siya sa U.S. noong 2001, nag-aral sa barber school sa Sacramento, at binuksan ang Chateau Barber Shop sa 1521 Third St., dating puwesto ng Phil&#39;s Barber Shop, noong Hunyo 2005 sa suporta ng kanyang yumaong asawa.</p><p>Pagkalipas ng dalawampung taon, isa na ito sa mga pangunahing barbershop sa Napa, na may pila hanggang labas at mga suki na galing pa sa Sonoma, Vallejo at maging San Francisco. Espesyalidad namin ang precision haircut, balbas, straight-razor shave at line work. Walang appointment: pumasok, umupo, at maging bahagi ng pamilya.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>122 review</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>20 taon</b><span>Sa Third St</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2005</b><span>Binuksan ni San ang shop</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Sa loob ng Chateau Barber Shop\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mga espesyalidad</p><h2>Ang aming ginagawa</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Standard na gupit</h3><span class=\"price\">$35</span></div><p>Precision cut, klasikong gupit-ginoo at mga pinakabagong uso.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Mga bata (10 pababa) at senior (65+)</h3><span class=\"price\">$25</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Balbas</h3></div><p>Pag-trim at paghubog ng balbas.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Straight razor shave</h3></div><p>Klasikong straight-razor at hot towel shave.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Line work</h3></div><p>Malinis na linya at gilid gamit ang straight razor.</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">Wala kaming price list online. Cash lang. Tumawag sa (707) 255-7662 kung may tanong.</p></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"team\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Ang team</p><h2>Sa likod ng upuan</h2><p>Hanapin si San, o umupo sa susunod na bakanteng upuan.</p></div><div class=\"team\"><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">S</div><div><h3>San</h3><p>Santysouk Yankee · May-ari mula 2005</p></div></div><p class=\"member-bio\">Taga-Laos si San at doon niya pinahusay ang kanyang galing bago lumipat dito noong 2001. 90% ng kanyang mga customer ay bumabalik linggo-linggo hanggang buwan-buwan.</p></article></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mabuting malaman</p><h2>Mga amenity at patakaran</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Walk-in lang</b><span>Kung sino ang mauna. Walang appointment</span></li><li><b>Cash lang</b></li><li><b>Accessible sa wheelchair</b></li><li><b>Paradahan sa kalye at parking lot</b><span>Sa pagitan ng Church St/4th St at School St</span></li><li><b>Magaling sa mga bata</b><span>Pumipili ng lollipop ang mga bata</span></li><li><b>May kainan sa tabi</b><span>Katabi lang ang Winston’s</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p><h2>Sa Chateau</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"Harapan ng Chateau Barber Shop at barber pole\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"Klasikong side part\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Mga upuan ng barbero at mga naka-frame na larawan\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fresh-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Bagong gupit, harap at gilid\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/logo-sign.jpg\" alt=\"Karatula ng Chateau Barber Shop\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/before-after.jpg\" alt=\"Bago at pagkatapos ng gupit\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chairs.jpg\" alt=\"Sa loob ng shop\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/classic-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Klasikong maikling gupit\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Sa balita</p><h2>Si San sa sarili niyang salita</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“My business has grown tremendously from initially being an unknown barbershop with just myself cutting hair to being one of the main barbershops in Napa. Through excellent customer reviews and word of mouth, I have been able to grow my business into what it is today.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, “Cuts and camaraderie,” Apr 22, 2025 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/san-yankee-chateau-barber-shop-napa/article_6afa35bb-180f-421f-8b1f-81a082fc4950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Having Winston’s next door has helped many people find my barber shop. Also, sometimes while waiting in line for a haircut customers will stop by Winston’s for something delicious to eat. We love being neighbors with them”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, Apr 22, 2025 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/san-yankee-chateau-barber-shop-napa/article_6afa35bb-180f-421f-8b1f-81a082fc4950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“We have people coming from Sonoma, Vallejo and sometimes even San Francisco”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, “Chateau Barber Shop celebrates decade of service,” Dec 15, 2015 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/chateau-barber-shop-celebrates-decade-of-service/article_26fc57db-4550-588f-8a20-742de348c257.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mga review</p><h2>Sabi ng aming mga customer</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 122 review</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 145 review</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Yelp →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“People typically wait for the owner, but Andrea would always give a perfect cut, spending the time to pay close attention to detail. I like that a bald fade was truly a bald fade when coming here, some places arent willing to fully shave down to the skin when asked. This place was my go-to while living in the area and was always worth the drive for me. Miss coming here and will definitely go back when Im local.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San, is great with kids when I first started taking my son there he was two and a half He&#39;s 15 now Love this place super quick super professional and does a great job !!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Adam W. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Mar 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“It is absolutely fabulous the owner&#39;s been cutting my hair for the past 15 years”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San has been doing my hair since I was young and I&#39;ve had 4 people ever doing my hair and she has done the best she is my favorite barber ever!and I totally recommend this barber shop.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nikolas R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“San is an amazing barber always friendly and can get you feeling brand new. If you are having a bad day go get a haircut but keep the negativity at home. If busy you should wait it&#39;s worth it.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“There&#39;s a long line, it&#39;s cash only and they have $30 haircuts; kids 10 and under, and seniors 65 and older $25. San is skilled and did an excellent job quickly.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Wayne G. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“San is amazing! I’ve been coming here for 10+ years. It’s First Come First Serve but she is efficient! After the first time I came she remembered my style. She’s the best. People wait for her for a reason.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San is the best in the business always delivers a fresh cut. Good prices Wait time not bad. Street parking and a parking lot. Downtown Napa.”</blockquote><figcaption>— John T. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Feb 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“We found our new spot to take my 5 year old for an amazing, quick, friendly, and stylish cut! San was amazing with my son and he loved getting to pick his own lollipop.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2020</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">FAQ</p><h2>Mga tanong, sinagot</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Tumatanggap ba kayo ng appointment?</summary><p>Hindi, walk-in lang kami, kung sino ang mauna. Minsan may pila hanggang labas, pero sulit ang paghihintay.</p></details><details><summary>Cash lang ba?</summary><p>Oo, cash lang kami.</p></details><details><summary>Magkano ang gupit?</summary><p>Mga $35 ang standard na gupit, at may bawas na presyo (mga $25) para sa mga batang 10 pababa at senior na 65 pataas. Maaaring magbago ang presyo, kaya tumawag sa amin sa (707) 255-7662.</p></details><details><summary>Anong oras kayo bukas?</summary><p>Bukas kami Martes hanggang Biyernes 9 AM–6 PM at Sabado 9 AM–4 PM. Sarado tuwing Linggo at Lunes.</p></details><details><summary>Saan ako puwedeng pumarada?</summary><p>May paradahan sa kalye at may parking lot sa malapit. Nasa 1521 3rd St kami sa downtown Napa.</p></details><details><summary>Gaano na katagal bukas ang shop?</summary><p>Binuksan ko ang Chateau Barber Shop noong Hunyo 2005, at ipinagdiwang namin ang ika-20 taon noong Hunyo 1, 2025.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Bisitahin kami</p>\n      <h2>Oras at lokasyon</h2>\n      <address>1521 3rd St<br>Napa, CA 94559</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\">(707) 255-7662</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>Sarado</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miyerkules</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Huwebes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Biyernes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sabado</td><td>9 AM – 4 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Linggo</td><td>Sarado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Walk-in lang, walang appointment. Cash lang.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/the_chateau_barbershop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@the_chateau_barbershop</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/293242531597152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel: